</span></span><span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(184, 10, 24);"></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(189, 15, 30);">lass</span><span class="token token attr-equals" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">=</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">"</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 0);">merci-card-text</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">"</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">&gt;</span><span>Pour leur soutien constant, leur encouragement dans les moments difficiles et leur fierté qui m'a portée jusqu'au bout de ce parcours.</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">&lt;/</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(184, 10, 24);">p</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">&gt;</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">&lt;/</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(184, 10, 24);">div</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Le <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">&lt;p c</code> suivi d'un retour à la ligne puis <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">lass="merci-card-text"&gt;</code> montre que la balise <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">&lt;p class="merci-card-text"&gt;</code> a été coupée en plein milieu — sans doute un copier-coller ou une édition qui a inséré un saut de ligne involontaire à cet endroit précis.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Envoie-moi le fichier et je te le renvoie corrigé en entier.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 pointer-coarse:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none rounded h-control font-sans text-body font-medium [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast focus-visible:shadow-focus text-primary aria-pressed:text-accent aspect-square w-control px-0 !text-muted hover:!text-primary" aria-label="Copier" data-testid="action-bar-copy" id="base-ui-_r_6su_"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] transition-colors duration-fast group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-expanded/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover inset-0 group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent cds-btn-squish "></span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 "><span class="relative"><span data-cds="Icon" class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-anthropicons, Anthropicons-Variable); font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-style: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; line-height: 1; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; user-select: none; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 433.3;"></spa